<headroom-library version="1" id="hg-gothenburg-harmony-lead" category="High Gain" order="180" instrument="guitar" style="Melodeath">
  <description>Melodic death metal lead: an overdrive pushing a 120-watt lead channel with the mids forward, into a British 4x12, with a clean, even echo behind it. Smooth, singing and focused, so twin-guitar harmony lines and fast melodic runs stay clear over blast beats.</description>
  <tags><tag>High Gain</tag><tag>Melodeath</tag><tag>Swedish</tag><tag>Lead</tag><tag>Harmony</tag><tag>Boosted</tag><tag>Delay</tag></tags>
